  {
   "id": "tides-of-tomorrow-305036@post-2026-04-24",
   "gameId": "tides-of-tomorrow-305036",
   "displayName": "Patch Note 2 - Delta Shipwreck fix and audio stuttering",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-04-24T10:47:12.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey Tidewalkers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Another day, another hotfix!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some of you encountered a blocking issue at Delta Shipwreck, where another boat was already docked, preventing you from docking your own.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This issue has now been fixed, so you can continue your adventure without interruption!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Regarding the audio stuttering",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "While the hotfix solved the audio stuttering issue for some players, others are unfortunately still affected.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’re continuing to investigate to find a stable, long-term fix. In the meantime, we’ve identified a temporary workaround that seems to help on some PCs:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Open Properties for Tides of Tomorrow",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(Left‑click on the game in your Steam Library)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Add -norhithread to the Launch Options",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Launch the game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This disables multi-threaded CPU rendering and may resolve the audio issues on some PCs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’re still working on a larger improvement patch coming in the next few days!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "May the Tides guide you! 🌊",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Build version: 1510‑44812",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
