  {
   "id": "tides-of-tomorrow-305036@major-2026-03-03",
   "gameId": "tides-of-tomorrow-305036",
   "displayName": "New Tides of Tomorrow trailer + demo update!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-03-03T14:07:29.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey Tidewalkers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We found a fancy new name for our unique asynchronous multiplayer feature: Online Story-Link! We just released a brand-new trailer that tells you everything you need to know about it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "But that’s not all! We’re also back with a big demo update!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Over the past three months, we’ve made a lot of improvements to the full game and you will now find many of these updates integrated into the demo version of Marketland!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "During our closed beta, players loved the boat gameplay… so we added boat gameplay in the demo! You can now try it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45050910/97a14620c4eae71544f3cc7127ed29bbd4808da8.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And there’s one more surprise waiting for you… At the very end of the demo, you’ll get a first glimpse of Pleasureland, a whole new area that will be fully explorable on April 22.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45050910/25403cb9e21c89518d74aa11210c88f2d7ee5647.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "With the addition of new content, old seeds are unfortunately no longer compatible!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "But feel free to jump back into the demo and share your new seed with us!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope you enjoy the update! Don’t hesitate to share your feedback with us here or on Discord — you’re helping shape the game every step of the way.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Don’t forget to wishlist the game to support us, and may the Tides guide you!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2678080/Tides_of_Tomorrow/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
